  <TutoText>k__BackingField: "Looks like there\u2019s more zombies than trinkets
    this time..\r\nTime to introduce you to the log. For the measly cost of 2 trinkets,
    you can set up a log that\u2019s 3 squares long. Be wary that you\u2019ll need
    these 3 squares of space to set it up. Meaning, no walls on these 3 squares.
    \r\nThe log will only be triggered when an enemy will walk on the pressure plate,
    triggering it and killing everything in its path."
